# Two races in a row (spec M5): rocket.scenario's race (the test game with a rocket), Up
# and the turbo burning the rocket, then Escape and Y; Return every 2 s through the
# results, the shop and its popup, the Underground Market and the sign-up into the next
# race. Run with --no-ai --watch: the rocket flames' picture (0x456AFC) in the original's
# memory from one race to the next; a run whose first race ends on the second picture
# tells keeping it from setting it back. A shot every second.
